File Index

/eval.ts
Purpose: Provides AI scoring helpers for evaluating token health, attacks, and enemy distances in a deterministic manner.

/greedy-policy.test.ts
Purpose: Tests the greedy AI policy's decision-making logic in combat scenarios.

/greedy-policy.ts
Purpose: Implements a greedy AI policy that prioritizes lethal attacks, then movement toward enemies.

/policy.ts
Purpose: Defines the interface for AI decision-making policies in a game engine.

/random-policy.test.ts
Purpose: Tests the deterministic behavior and action selection of the random AI policy.

/random-policy.ts
Purpose: Implements a random AI policy that selects legal actions uniformly at random.
